{"4575280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snowball Party", "steam_appid": 4575280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4768110], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer casual sports competition game supporting up to 10 players. Players transform into red and blue team snowmen to compete in ball games within a dreamy stadium amidst swirling snow, featuring a variety of gameplay modes to choose from. <br>The game features realistic physics simulation with simple, easy-to-learn controls, allowing players to enjoy a casual and relaxing entertainment atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Football Mode】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score by kicking the ball into the opponent's goal! Use WASD keys to move, Shift to sprint, and Space to jump. When you get close to the ball, you can push it along as it rolls. Click the left mouse button to kick the ball. Adjust your kicking angle by changing your position and camera height. Sprinting gives your kick more power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575280/extras/d1f0de88b0752dd1986a12a0853573cb.avif?t=1784554600\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575280/extras_big/d1f0de88b0752dd1986a12a0853573cb.avif?t=1784554600 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Volleyball Mode】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the ball hit the ground on your side! Same controls: use WASD keys to move, Shift to sprint, and Space to jump. When you get close to the volleyball, click the left mouse button to hit it. Adjust your hitting angle by changing your position and camera height. Sprinting gives your hit more power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575280/extras/afaeba9601909d54a7791336fbc0b46c.avif?t=1784554600\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575280/extras_big/afaeba9601909d54a7791336fbc0b46c.avif?t=1784554600 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer casual sports competition game supporting up to 10 players. Players transform into red and blue team snowmen to compete in ball games within a dreamy stadium amidst swirling snow, featuring a variety of gameplay modes to choose from. <br>The game features realistic physics simulation with simple, easy-to-learn controls, allowing players to enjoy a casual and relaxing entertainment atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Football Mode】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score by kicking the ball into the opponent's goal! Use WASD keys to move, Shift to sprint, and Space to jump. When you get close to the ball, you can push it along as it rolls. Click the left mouse button to kick the ball. Adjust your kicking angle by changing your position and camera height. Sprinting gives your kick more power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575280/extras/d1f0de88b0752dd1986a12a0853573cb.avif?t=1784554600\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575280/extras_big/d1f0de88b0752dd1986a12a0853573cb.avif?t=1784554600 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【Volleyball Mode】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the ball hit the ground on your side! Same controls: use WASD keys to move, Shift to sprint, and Space to jump. When you get close to the volleyball, click the left mouse button to hit it. Adjust your hitting angle by changing your position and camera height. Sprinting gives your hit more power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn